abstract: >-
  Research software for ΛCDM+S (entropy-extended cosmology). Layer-1
  first-principles derivation from Hubble-horizon thermodynamics and
  Layer-3 Bayesian validation against compressed cosmological likelihoods.
  This citation describes the software package, not a journal article.
